{"sha": "275351ae803ad6e54ededf91a16c9157bba14a566efcc5fad837636888dcddeb", "body": ["\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[font=\\small, >=Stealth]", "  \\foreach \\y/\\l in {0/{$S_0$}, 3.4/{$S_1$}, 5.6/{$S_2$}}{", "    \\draw[omstate] (0,\\y) -- (3.6,\\y); \\node[anchor=east] at (-0.1,\\y) {\\l};", "    \\foreach \\d in {0.25,0.5,0.75}{\\draw[omvib] (0,\\y+\\d) -- (3.6,\\y+\\d);}}", "  \\draw[omstate] (5.0,2.5) -- (7.6,2.5); \\node[anchor=west] at (7.7,2.5) {$T_1$};", "  \\foreach \\d in {0.25,0.5,0.75}{\\draw[omvib] (5.0,2.5+\\d) -- (7.6,2.5+\\d);}", "  \\draw[omabs] (0.3,0) -- (0.3,4.15) node[pos=0.35, left, font=\\scriptsize, align=right] {吸收};", "  \\draw[omabs] (0.7,0) -- (0.7,5.85);", "  \\draw[omnonrad] (1.05,5.85) -- (1.05,5.6);", "  \\draw[omnonrad] (1.05,5.6) -- (1.05,3.4) node[pos=0.5, right, font=\\scriptsize] {内转换};", "  \\draw[omnonrad] (0.45,4.15) -- (0.45,3.42);", "  \\draw[omfluo] (1.7,3.4) -- (1.7,0.5) node[pos=0.5, right, font=\\scriptsize, align=left] {荧光};", "  \\draw[omnonrad] (3.2,3.4) -- (3.2,0.02) node[pos=0.5, right, font=\\scriptsize] {内转换};", "  \\draw[omisc] (3.6,3.4) -- (5.0,3.1) node[pos=0.5, above, font=\\scriptsize] {系间窜越};", "  \\draw[omnonrad] (5.3,3.1) -- (5.3,2.52);", "  \\draw[omphos] (6.0,2.5) -- (6.0,0.5) node[pos=0.5, right, font=\\scriptsize, align=left] {磷光};", "  \\draw[omisc] (5.6,2.5) -- (3.7,0.02) node[pos=0.45, above left, font=\\scriptsize, inner sep=1pt] {系间窜越};", "  \\draw[omvib, dashed] (3.6,0.5) -- (6.0,0.5);", "  \\draw[omvib, dashed] (3.6,0.0) -- (7.6,0.0);", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 雅布隆斯基图。直箭头：吸收（蓝色）、荧光（红色）、", "磷光（橙色）；波浪箭头：振动弛豫和", "内转换（IC）；虚线波浪箭头：系间窜越（ISC）。", "发射始于 $S_1$ 或 $T_1$ 的最低振动能级，", "并可终止于 $S_0$ 的任一能级。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[卡莎规则]\\label{prop:b3:electronic-spectroscopy:kasha}", "除极少数例外，发光总是来自同一自旋多重度中的最低激发态", "（$S_1$ 或 $T_1$），与最初被激发到哪个态无关：", "\\emph{卡莎规则}\\index{卡莎规则}。", "\\end{proposition}", "\\begin{proof}[说明]", "该规律由实验确立；其原因在于，位于较高激发态之间的", "内转换（这些态彼此靠得很近）远快于发射，", "而 $S_1$--$S_0$ 能隙较大。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[镜像关系]\\label{prop:b3:electronic-spectroscopy:mirror}", "若激发态与基态具有相似的振动结构，则", "荧光带是第一吸收带关于它们共同的", "0--0 线的镜像；发射位于更长波长处（斯托克斯位移）。", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "吸收由 $v'' = 0$ 跃迁至各振动能级 $v'$（均属 $S_1$），位于 $E_{00} + v'h\\nu'$；发射", "由 $v' = 0$ 跃迁至各振动能级 $v''$（均属 $S_0$），位于 $E_{00} - v''h\\nu''$。", "若两者频率相同且弗兰克–康登因子相同（位移相等），", "则两个振动序列关于 $E_{00}$ 对称。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}", "\\begin{axis}[width=0.75\\linewidth, height=5cm, xmin=17, xmax=33, ymin=0,", "  ymax=1.15, axis x line=bottom, axis y line=left, ytick=\\empty,", "  xlabel={波数 / $10^3$ cm$^{-1}$}, ylabel={强度},", "  legend cell align=left, legend style={font=\\small, draw=none, at={(0.02,0.97)}, anchor=north west},", "  tick label style={font=\\small}, label style={font=\\small}]", "\\addplot[omDef, thick] table[x=nu, y=abs] {figdata/out/bachelor-3-photophysics-bands.dat};", "\\addlegendentry{吸收}", "\\addplot[omThm, thick] table[x=nu, y=em] {figdata/out/bachelor-3-photophysics-bands.dat};", "\\addlegendentry{荧光}", "\\draw[gray, dashed] (axis cs:25,0) -- (axis cs:25,1.12);", "\\node[font=\\scriptsize, gray, anchor=south west] at (axis cs:25,1.0) {0--0};", "\\end{axis}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 某模型分子的吸收光谱与荧光光谱（$S = 1$，振动", "量子 \\qty{1400}{cm^{-1}}）：关于 0--0 线互为镜像；", "两极大值之间的间隔即为斯托克斯位移。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\section{激发态动力学}", "", "激发后，$S_1$ 的布居数通过其所有可进行的过程衰减，", "各过程均为一级：辐射衰变 $k_r$、内转换 $k_{\\mathrm{IC}}$、", "系间窜越 $k_{\\mathrm{ISC}}$。", "", "\\begin{definition}[激发态寿命、辐射寿命]\\label{def:b3:electronic-spectroscopy:lifetime}", "\\emph{激发态寿命}\\index{激发态寿命}为 $\\tau =", "1/\\sum k$，即激发态布居数的指数衰减", "的时间常数。\\emph{辐射寿命}\\index{辐射寿命} $\\tau_r =", "1/k_r$ 是该态若以发射为其唯一去路时所具有的", "寿命。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{definition}[量子产率]\\label{def:b3:electronic-spectroscopy:quantum-yield}", "紧随光吸收之后发生的某一过程的\\emph{量子产率}\\index{量子产率}，", "等于该过程发生的次数除以所吸收的光子数。", "\\emph{荧光量子产率}\\index{荧光量子产率} $\\Phi_F$", "为每吸收一个光子", "所发射的荧光光子数。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[量子产率与寿命]\\label{prop:b3:electronic-spectroscopy:quantum-yield}", "$\\Phi_F = k_r/(k_r + k_{\\mathrm{IC}} + k_{\\mathrm{ISC}}) = k_r\\tau = \\tau/\\tau_r$；同理", "$\\Phi_{\\mathrm{ISC}} = k_{\\mathrm{ISC}}\\tau$，且各竞争过程的产率", "之和为 1。", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "$\\dd[S_1]/\\dd t = -(k_r + k_{\\mathrm{IC}} + k_{\\mathrm{ISC}})[S_1]$，于是 $[S_1] = [S_1]_0\\eu^{-t/\\tau}$。", "发射的光子数为 $\\int_0^\\infty k_r[S_1]\\,\\dd t = k_r\\tau[S_1]_0$，", "占 $[S_1]_0$ 个激发分子的份额。对各 $k$ 作同样的积分即得各产率，", "其和为 $\\tau\\sum k = 1$。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{definition}[荧光猝灭剂、动态猝灭与静态猝灭]\\label{def:b3:electronic-spectroscopy:quencher}", "\\emph{荧光猝灭剂}\\index{荧光猝灭剂}是一种", "使荧光减弱的物质。在\\emph{动态猝灭}\\index{动态猝灭}中，", "它通过碰撞使激发分子失活，附加速率 $k_q[Q]$，", "并缩短寿命；在\\emph{静态猝灭}\\index{静态猝灭}中，它", "与基态分子形成不发荧光的配合物，使", "荧光强度降低，而仍在发光的分子的寿命不变。", "\\end{definition}", ""]}